        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, mineral wool insulation 50mm, cladding with aluminium sheet</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, mineral wool insulation 50mm, cladding with aluminium sheet
Disposal process for thermal insulation of pipes for heating systems;
UUID: 400bdd66-bf62-4904-a5f1-12931de946ce
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal parts (Aluminium) are recycled, plastic parts (PUR/PIR, PVC) are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock or glass wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_400bdd66-bf62-4904-a5f1-12931de946ce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
